  partName: Heat Shield (3)
  description: The Heat Shield (3) is a small, thin-flat metal component located
    at the middle-left-rear of the engine, serving as a protective barrier against
    high temperatures generated by the engine. Its metal-dark material provides excellent
    heat resistance, and its compact size allows for easy installation in tight spaces.
    Interestingly, the Heat Shield (3) is designed to be easily removable for maintenance
    and inspection purposes.
